  m_Name: MCQ_008
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MCQQuestionData
  questionText: Spermiation is
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: In the testis, diploid spermatocytes transform into haploid sperms
    by the process of spermatogenesis. Spermiation is the release of sperms into
    the lumen of seminiferous tubules.
  options:
  - The release of sperms into the lumen of the seminiferous tubule.
  - The process of formation of sperms.
  - The formation of secondary spermatocytes.
  - The formation of spermatids.
  correctOptionIndex: 0
